    "body": "Here i'll put whatever I find about the ` Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'onShowLinkUnderline')` that happens when navigating away from the logs creen.\n\n```bash\n0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:13 Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'onShowLinkUnderline')\n    at new iZ (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:13:21354)\n    at sz.createInstance (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:15:17077)\n    at rY._createRenderer (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:17:24888)\n    at Object.dispose (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:1:93084)\n    at h.dispose (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:1:75958)\n    at rJ._wrappedAddonDispose (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:17:38413)\n    at i.dispose (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:17:38144)\n    at rJ.dispose (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:17:38028)\n    at eg (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:7:1973)\n    at e.clear (0hf6n8w6wz09x.js:7:3923)\n```\n\nBy grepping `onShowLinkUnderline` i'm only getting xterm results and the only file in \\manage\\tools\\logs that imports xterm is terminal.tsx\n\nGrepping more things:\n\n```bash\nroot@HomarrDEV:~ # grep -rnHo _createRenderer /root/homarr/node_modules/@xterm\n/root/homarr/node_modules/@xterm/addon-canvas/src/CanvasAddon.ts:63:_createRenderer\n```\n[link](https://npmx.dev/package-code/@xterm/addon-canvas/v/0.7.0/src%2FCanvasAddon.ts)\nThat's what termina.tsx imports!\n\nI think the problem is around here:\n\n```ts\nthis.register(toDisposable(() => {\n  renderService.setRenderer((this._terminal as any)._core._createRenderer());\n  renderService.handleResize(terminal.cols, terminal.rows);\n  this._renderer?.dispose();\n  this._renderer = undefined;\n}));\n```\n\nAnd here is when I lose it, really. It seems like there's some sort of race condition or something where CanvasAddon tries to create a new renderer just as we are leaving the page and by that time `onShowLinkUnderline` no longer exists and it crashes. ",
